+Input: one transaction per line, `date<TAB>account<TAB>amount[<TAB>currency]`
+(ISO date, amount with up to two decimals). The currency is an ISO 4217 code:
+exactly three uppercase ASCII letters, e.g. `EUR`. When the fourth column is
+missing the currency is `USD`. Surrounding whitespace is trimmed from every
